<title>USA: Bradlees Inc receives financing extension.</title>
<headline>Bradlees Inc receives financing extension.</headline>
<dateline>BRAINTREE, Mass. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradlees Inc said Thursday it received a one year extension of its $200 million Debtor-In-Possession (DIP) financing agreement, subject to the approval of the U.S. Bankruptcy Court.</p>
<p>This action extends the DIP agreement until June 23, 1998 and provides the company with ample liquidity based upon its business plan, Bradlees said.</p>
</text>
